{"id": "86328", "name": "אי-שוויון פולינומי – מכפלת חזקות זוגית ואי-זוגית ≤ 0 (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Solve the following inequality:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}} \\le 0. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>Write your answer as a logical sequence of inequalities, such as \"<code dir=\"ltr\">x&gt;=13</code>\" or \"<code dir=\"ltr\">x&gt;=-9 or x&gt;5</code>\".</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">Solution: [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> An even power never changes the sign of a product, so only the factor with the odd power decides the sign.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — The even power</b><br>The factor \\(({{CT:1}})^{{CT:2}}\\) is never negative because of the even power: it is positive for <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:3}}\\ne {{CT:4}}\\)</span> and equal to <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(0\\)</span> at <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:3}}={{CT:4}}\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — The odd power</b><br>The other factor \\(({{CT:5}})^{{CT:6}}\\) which has an odd power has the same sign as <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:7}}\\)</span>: it changes sign across \\({{CT:3}} = {{CT:8}}\\) (negative for <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:3}} &lt; {{CT:8}}\\)</span>, positive for <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:3}} &gt; {{CT:8}}\\)</span>).</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 3 — Putting them together</b><br>For <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:3}}\\ne {{CT:4}}\\)</span> the first factor is positive, so the inequality is satisfied for \\(({{CT:5}})\\le 0\\), i.e. <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:3}}\\le {{CT:8}}\\)</span>. At <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:3}}={{CT:4}}\\)</span> the product is <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(0\\)</span>, so this point is a solution too; it already lies in <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:3}}\\le {{CT:8}}\\)</span> because <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:4}} &lt; {{CT:8}}\\)</span>. Hence<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:3}}\\le {{CT:8}} \\]</p>This is entered as \\({{CT:3}} &lt;= {{CT:8}}\\).</div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "solve", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "requirelowestterms": true}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["correctanswer", "degr1", "degr2", "n1", "n2", "p", "v"], "nvariants": 50}